Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:42.70,H_en,,0,0,0,,"If you kill a weasel... will it take your soul?" Folk horror rules
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:42.70,C_en,,0,0,0,,Watch ALL episodes FREE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_en,,0,0,0,,The weasel's kin demands a life for a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:02.12,S_en,,0,0,0,,So if you run over a weasel,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.33,S_en,,0,0,0,,will it come for your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:07.94,S_en,,0,0,0,,That depends — was it on purpose or an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:08.88,S_en,,0,0,0,,What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:10.10,S_en,,0,0,0,,If it was an accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:11.46,S_en,,0,0,0,,burn offerings and apologize — enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:12.74,S_en,,0,0,0,,But it must come with true remorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:13.98,S_en,,0,0,0,,But if it was deliberate,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:16.04,S_en,,0,0,0,,then a life for a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:18.68,S_en,,0,0,0,,Why is a stranger's voice inside my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:20.40,S_en,,0,0,0,,Our bodies have every aperture open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:21.56,S_en,,0,0,0,,When spirits occupy an aperture
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:22.88,S_en,,0,0,0,,and want to talk, this happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:25.04,S_en,,0,0,0,,This is heart-sense. There's also eye-sense and ear-sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:26.04,S_en,,0,0,0,,To speak with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:27.40,S_en,,0,0,0,,just pray silently in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:28.68,S_en,,0,0,0,,Don't mix in your own thoughts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:29.84,S_en,,0,0,0,,or your readings will never be accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.64,S_en,,0,0,0,,Eye-sense is the yin-yang eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:33.00,S_en,,0,0,0,,Ear-sense hears the spirits speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.12,S_en,,0,0,0,,They let you see and hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:36.08,S_en,,0,0,0,,It all depends on your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:38.00,S_en,,0,0,0,,How do I know which spirit is talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.16,S_en,,0,0,0,,Fox, weasel, ghost immortals —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:40.40,S_en,,0,0,0,,each feels different when it comes over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.70,S_en,,0,0,0,,You'll learn to tell them apart.
